* Checkpoint 3 regression check: checkpoint 2's control flow and
* DEFINE still work completely unchanged -- adding the pattern
* sublanguage added new statement forms, it did not touch these.
        DEFINE('DOUBLE(X)')
        N = 1
LOOP    OUTPUT = DOUBLE(N)
        N = N + 1
        GT(N,3)                  :F(LOOP)
END     N = N
DOUBLE  DOUBLE = X * 2           :(RETURN)
